        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Finally, we have been rapidly developing HPE VM Essentials, an enterprise-grade hypervisor for virtual machines, along with the ability to manage cloud-native applications using containerization, or specialized workload needs with bare metal as a service.",
        "start_character": 31760,
        "end_character": 32015
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For a discussion of certain risks attendant to these competitive environments, see “Risk Factors” in Item 1A of Part I of this Annual Report on Form 10-K under the heading “We operate in an intensely competitive industry, and competitive pressures could harm our business and financial performance.”",
        "start_character": 44521,
        "end_character": 44820
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For a discussion of risks attendant to intellectual property rights, see “Risk Factors” in Item 1A of Part I of this Annual Report on Form 10-K under the headings “Our financial performance may suffer if we cannot continue to develop, license, or enforce the intellectual property rights on which our businesses depend” and “Our products and services depend in part on intellectual property and technology licensed from third parties.”",
        "start_character": 36770,
        "end_character": 37205
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From time to time, the markets in which we sell our products, services, and solutions experience weak economic conditions that may negatively affect sales.",
        "start_character": 37218,
        "end_character": 37373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we are advancing our SaaS capabilities by creating cloud-native, cloud-based server management solutions to enhance our existing portfolio.",
        "start_character": 28939,
        "end_character": 29091
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we believe that technology will be fundamental to finding solutions to achieve compliance with and manage those requirements, and we are collaborating with industry, business groups and governments to find and promote ways that our technology can be used to address climate change and other environmental-related issues, and to facilitate compliance with related laws, regulations and treaties.",
        "start_character": 61063,
        "end_character": 61466
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our use of outsourced design and contract manufacturers, we currently manufacture a limited number of finished products from components and subassemblies that we acquire from a wide range of vendors.",
        "start_character": 21172,
        "end_character": 21386
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we compete with many of our current and potential partners, including OEMs that design, manufacture, and market their products under their own brand names.",
        "start_character": 38980,
        "end_character": 39148
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "This has resulted in a combined go-to-market model, in which we have a direct sales presence in a number of countries, while we sell and deliver our products, solutions, and services through a channel-only model in the remaining countries.",
        "start_character": 19659,
        "end_character": 19898
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a variety of services, including professional, maintenance, and support services;",
        "start_character": 10017,
        "end_character": 10112
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that we will continue to have significant R&D expenditures in the future to support the design and development of innovative, high-quality products, services, and solutions to maintain and enhance our competitive position.",
        "start_character": 28377,
        "end_character": 28613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001645590-25-000130",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001645590-25-000130-8188b88b16d1e219",
        "accession_number": "0001645590-25-000130",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also expanding our wide area networking product offering, and leveraging the same AI platform as our wireless and wired switching portfolio.",
        "start_character": 32904,
        "end_character": 33051
      }
